<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's Telebras 7-mo net 1.573 bln reais.</title>
<headline>Brazil's Telebras 7-mo net 1.573 bln reais.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian federally owned telecommunications giant Telebras released the following results for the first seven months of 1996.</p>
<p>			  Jan-July 1996     Jan-July 1995</p>
<p>    Consolidated net   1.573 bln	    N/A</p>
<p>    Operating revs     9.333 bln	    N/A</p>
<p>    Holding net	  1.903 bln	    N/A</p>
<p>    Share net		N/A		  N/A</p>
<p>Note: All figures are in Brazilian reais.</p>
<p>The company released the figures Wednesday night to Brazilian stock exchanges.</p>
<p>Full name of company is Telecomunicacoes Brasileiras SA</p>
<p>-- James Craig, Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 232 4411</p>
